  <item>
    <title>ep29 人类恋爱观察日记1</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/655c16c1f10bbce635f2d0d1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">655c16c1f10bbce635f2d0d1</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 23 Nov 2023 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期内容简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>不论是金莎在《爱的修学旅行》中让人大呼不值的小男友，还是《再见爱人》给我们抛出的“婚姻脚本更迭”难题。我们总是在新的爱情实践里，发现那些性别新思潮与旧话语交织的复杂性，或如《花束般的恋爱》所呈现的消费逻辑下的灵魂伴侣幻觉。在见证爱的终结之前，不如先让我们看看爱怎样证明？今天我们不当“爱情判官”，只做观察家。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：小小观察家薏米炮手&amp;局外人寒冰炮手</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 问题一：女生的包应该男朋友背吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="426">07:06</a> 当相处细节成为爱的证明</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="789">13:09</a> &nbsp;当性别分工模式成为习惯时，女性处处面临风险</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1084">18:04</a> 问题二：恋爱中男女是否需要就花费进行aa？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a> 潜藏于经济计较背后的更为复杂的现实和心理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1636">27:16</a> &nbsp;恋爱、婚姻模式的代际传承性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1955">32:35</a> 警惕新瓶装旧酒的性别分工模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2242">37:22</a> 恋爱中的既有又要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2631">43:51</a> 婚恋发生必要性的疑问</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2753">45:53</a> 婚姻和家庭功能化导致的计算</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2888">48:08</a> &nbsp;无法体验到的的无条件的爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3530">58:50</a> 终究要学会爱自己</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本节目提到的内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《为爱成婚：婚姻与爱情的前世今生》斯蒂芬妮·孔茨著；刘君宇译</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本节目已同步更新于苹果播客、小宇宙播客App、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、蜻蜓FM平台，欢迎选择您常用的音频软件收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱 -莫文蔚</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljCo-axztWvwDfi1j3Q0kMUo7mIg.m4a" length="92526983" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:03:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZuYVoxZ3VkakxrT3hCX3ZJTjg1SXFGREc0Z0sucG5n.png"/>
